# 统一行尾：上游仓库以 LF 存储，强制工作区也用 LF
# 避免 Windows 下 autocrlf 造成的「整文件 diff」噪音
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须 CRLF，否则 cmd.exe 解析 label/goto 可能出错
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做行尾转换
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pyd binary
*.so binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.flac binary
*.ogg binary
